      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ROM",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "For if you live after the flesh, you must die; but if by the Spirit you put to death the deeds of the body, you will live.",
      "ko": "너희가 육신대로 살면 반드시 죽을 것이로되 영으로써 몸의 행실을 죽이면 살리니",
      "source_text_hash": "cae055e4dec974e22e917f744ee2590e0708f2b64ca38543501a086f684684c5",
      "translation_text_hash": "f6f9c97e26819c1a38ee7c009dfd095835124fa69b6cc5fa9b81ac3713685e21",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너희가 육신대로 살면 반드시 죽을 것이로되 영으로써 몸의 행실을 죽이면 살리니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f6f9c97e26819c1a38ee7c009dfd095835124fa69b6cc5fa9b81ac3713685e21"
      ]
    },
    {
