      "en": "For I consider that the sufferings of this present time are not worthy to be compared with the glory which will be revealed toward us.",
      "ko": "생각건대 현재의 고난은 장차 우리에게 나타날 영광과 족히 비교할 수 없도다",
      "source_text_hash": "8dea536634d81a2057a1d668e858802efa8ebfe176ade1b78b66a249c9a5a0a2",
      "translation_text_hash": "3cbbfa16ae973f02700e6665659b56ee1ac4feaaa25ccc5cab947dacecd6d5e1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
