      "en": "For the creation was subjected to vanity, not of its own will, but because of him who subjected it, in hope",
      "ko": "피조물이 허무한데 굴복하는 것은 자기 뜻이 아니요 오직 굴복케 하시는 이로 말미암음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "718a973b15f942c99bab61831ff536f11a60de02e5e0d80e9e74b8cede28617c",
      "translation_text_hash": "ed349ea159fe11577e4122d3a73f96d757e8cad682e1b1f4258f9295d4a2921b",
