      "en": "For we were saved in hope, but hope that is seen is not hope. For who hopes for that which he sees?",
      "ko": "우리가 소망으로 구원을 얻었으매 보이는 소망이 소망이 아니니 보는 것을 누가 바라리요",
      "source_text_hash": "d8008369339105b18d29bb567740bc854e9884ca8ad02e3e42ec3eeabcc044c3",
      "translation_text_hash": "66dd1d34f289e593a2cd5c88235985034641279238518e58df8332ce61e5cb0e",
